Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `total` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/lambda_mut_borrow_conflict.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     total += 1
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through a write parameter, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass `total` only once, or copy first with `total.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
